        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-DVS100024HEXSBR, Solid Brass Hexagon Glass Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Hexagon Glass Door Pull has a transitional style that makes it a great choice for current home builds or remodels. This luxury shower door pull not only exemplifies style, it is made with the utmost care and attention to detail. First Impressions' Craftsman make all of their hardware right here in the USA. The Solid Brass Hexagon Glass Door Pull is 24 inches long with an 18 inch center to center mounting distance. This Modern Shower Door Pull is available in all the latest finish color choices.  It is packed with everything you will need to install it on your glass shower door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/hexagon-door-pull-first-impressions-dvs100hexsbr\"><b>Hexagon Door Pull</b></a> in other sizes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions SD-DVS100024HEXSBR Davis Hexagon Shower Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DVS01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262335\"><b>First Impressions DVS100024HEXSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 8 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 1 door pull, 2 inside screw covers, plus mounting hardware for mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
